<title>UK: RheinHyp sets 135 million mark structured bond.</title>
<headline>RheinHyp sets 135 million mark structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Rheinische Hypothekenbank</p>
<p> AMT    135 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0 PCT  MATURITY  **14.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE  S-04.SEP.96</p>
<p>FULL FEES  UNDISC</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 13.JAN.97 THEN 5.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     **CALLABLE AT PAR 14.JAN.97 ONLY</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
